# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the root
# `.dockerignore`, so this file scopes the k2-capture build context to this
# service without touching the rest of the repo. Without it the context is the
# whole 3.3 GB working tree, ~615 MB of which is the local Iceberg warehouse.
#
# Everything is excluded, then the two directories the build actually reads are
# added back. Last match wins.
*
!services/capture-rust
!schemas/avro

# Build output and test data are not inputs to the image.
services/capture-rust/target
services/capture-rust/tests/fixtures
services/capture-rust/README.md
